OL,3,GNEWSAYoung Scots cyclist 'surprised' by
OL,4,ATour of Britain result
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf Elliot Rowe looked a little bemused
OL,7,Fwhen he secured the white jersey for
OL,8,Fbest young rider at the Tour of Britain
OL,9,Frecently it was perhaps to be expected.
OL,11,FThe 20-year-old from Aberdeenshire
OL,12,Fadmitted he suprised even himself with
OL,13,Fhis sixth place finish overall despite
OL,14,Fbeing one of the youngest riders in the
OL,15,F108-strong field.
OL,17,FHe looked at home in the race which
OL,18,Fconcluded with a stage which started
OL,19,Fand finished in Earlston in the
OL,20,FScottish Borders on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
