OL,3,GNEWSAYoung Scots cyclist 'surprised' by
OL,4,ATour of Britain result
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is a performance which has earned
OL,7,Fcomparisons with Kelso's Oscar Onley
OL,8,Fwho has been busy lighting up the
OL,9,FVuelta a Espana of late.
